@format 1
@id media-preview.in-funnel
@title In Funnel
@section Media preview
@area In Funnel
@entry funnel-path-change
@summary Show the Funnel-specific selected-path adapter that requests a source in the preview viewer.
@related media-selection.common.files-selection, media-preview.common.viewer-gate
@tag media
@tag preview
@tag funnel

@alias funnel = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PFunnelTab

[funnel-path-change] Funnel Files current-path event <input>
~ This starts when the selected file changes in the Funnel tab.
[Technical explanation]
= PListPathChange delivered the current path to PFunnelPathShow.
> funnel-path-result

[funnel-path-result] Funnel selected-path adapter <decision>
~ The Funnel tab decides whether the selected file should be opened in the preview.
[Technical explanation]
- Ignore a blank path; otherwise request it from the Funnel viewer @ funnel.PFunnelPathShow(...)
? "Nonblank current path" > map:media-preview.common.viewer-gate
? "Blank current path" > funnel-no-request

[funnel-no-request] Funnel preview request omitted <output>
~ This path ends with funnel preview request omitted.
[Technical explanation]
= Funnel does not call the shared viewer-preview pipeline for a blank path.
